            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Before the new one: say the Hindi for petrol, then the Hindi for a telephone."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: पत्र",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "पत्र — patra — \"a letter (formal)\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "पत्र (patra) is Sanskrit pattra, \"wing-feather; leaf; leaf of a book\", taken over whole as a learned loan, a tatsama (CDIAL 7733). A letter is a leaf of writing. CDIAL lists the inherited form as pattā, \"leaf\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for this chapter."
